{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup using ViT-L image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion, replicating the configuration of config_025. Validation accuracy improved to 0.7062 (vs 0.6352 in config_025), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may impact performance. However, uncertainty remains about whether this improvement is consistent across configurations or influenced by other factors like data characteristics or fusion strategies."
}

